<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6726"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sherlock<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sherlock<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 1:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t think any of these people posting as BTK are the real killer. Too risky a proposition. Much easier to make drops. The guy using the name &#34;BTK&#34; sounds like he or she needs to get out of the house more. Christ on the Cross is creepy, though.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
