<!--/Post: 6780-->
<!--Post: 6786--><!--Time: 1108008450-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6786"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sherlock<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sherlock<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 8:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The crystal climbs the vine with the mouse on its back, and Mama knows who swept the porch for the seventh time. <BR> <BR>Not bad, heh? If I come up with a name like Bone Toy Kidman and post my message under Messages from BTK---all of a sudden I&#39;m a serial killer suspect and I&#39;ve got people trying to decipher my message and reading hidden meanings into it when the truth is I made it up in about forty-five seconds.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
